Posix shell project

Hello friend i have create a posix shell project which supporting feature such as binary execution, pipe, file redirection, signal 

In this project i have learn about standard system call and rule and architecture of unix os and also learn about to navigate unix or linux man and understand the funcationality of the C library, System call and utility tool

System call i have used for this
fork
execvp
chdir
and many more

To make this project over engineer and useless 

Instead of have having one project file i have spit it into 5 different file and during compilation instead of using make i am manually compiling the project and run it

And instead of using c library for converting string into token i have manually chop the string into token code in (token.parser.c)

The started way for text formation in project as shell is to build command in tree datastructure so instead of tree i have used flat array 

And while prompting command he printf useless message in while prompting command it display hello sir how can i help you
